# Every claim a driver makes with derivation platform-invariant: file|attribute|value.
# The derivation does not say "we read this" — it says the platform CANNOT be
# otherwise, which is a statement about the service rather than about the resource.
# Each line here was checked against the provider's own description; the two that
# were false are recorded in D799. A claim not on this list has not been reviewed,
# and the gate fails rather than let it pass as if it had been.
aws/apprunner_net.go|availability.class|"regional"
aws/apprunner_net.go|tls.enforced|true
